Spec: Local server lease interoperability fixture issuer

Purpose:
  Issue actual standard JWS fixtures for independent .NET and Java Agent verification.

Owns:
  ./main.go

Must:
  Generate ephemeral keys in memory and export only public certificates, snapshots and test tokens into a caller-protected fresh artifact directory.
  Produce valid and cryptographically signed malformed cases without placing tokens in command-line or stdout.
  Never contact cloud services or turn fixture identities into running gateway authority.
